# ALLOWLIST for /var/lib/portage/world on a TEST machine: every world entry must match one of these shell globs (cat/pkg).
# Public Horcrux editions (server core, gnome-light, XFCE small-device profile) + test tooling + machine HARDWARE enablement + agent plumbing.
# A new entry is a deliberate act: add it here (with the reason) in the same change that installs it. Anything else = personal app = fails the lab.
# --- Horcrux product (all editions)
app-misc/horcrux-*
sys-apps/horcrux-*
net-misc/horcrux-*
sys-kernel/horcrux-*
gnome-extra/horcrux-*
app-emulation/horcrux*
app-misc/*-machine
# --- machine layers: hardware / first-boot plumbing (no personal apps; verified by the denylist). The owner's private gringotts-config/-tools are NOT
# allowed any more (2026-11-05: their config + first-boot service moved to plain files / horcrux-firstboot).
# --- hardware enablement (T2 Touch Bar/fans/Wi-Fi firmware, Surface kernel, microcode, firmware, fingerprint reader)
sys-firmware/*
sys-kernel/*
sys-apps/t2fanrd
sys-apps/tiny-dfr
sys-auth/fprintd
sys-apps/fwupd
sys-power/*
net-wireless/*
# --- base system / tools
app-admin/sudo
app-admin/sysklogd
app-crypt/argon2
app-editors/nano
app-editors/vim
app-cdr/cdrtools
dev-db/sqlite
dev-libs/libisoburn
dev-vcs/git
app-misc/jq
app-misc/tmux
app-portage/eix
app-portage/portage-utils
app-eselect/eselect-repository
media-fonts/terminus-font
sys-apps/dbus
sys-apps/gptfdisk
sys-apps/memtest86+
sys-apps/pciutils
sys-apps/usbutils
sys-apps/net-tools
sys-block/*
sys-boot/*
sys-fs/*
sys-process/*
sys-auth/elogind
net-misc/chrony
net-misc/curl
net-misc/dhcpcd
net-misc/networkmanager
net-misc/openssh
net-misc/bridge-utils
net-dns/*
net-firewall/nftables
net-vpn/wireguard-tools
net-print/*
net-misc/ctg-ssh-ca
net-misc/ctg-ssh-ca-fleet
# --- test tooling / virtualisation the lab exercises
app-benchmarks/stress-ng
app-emulation/libvirt
app-emulation/qemu
app-emulation/virt-manager
app-emulation/virt-viewer
app-emulation/libguestfs*
app-containers/*
sys-cluster/horcrux*
media-sound/alsa-utils
# --- public desktop editions
gnome-base/gdm
gnome-base/gnome-light
gnome-extra/gnome-tweaks
gnome-extra/gnome-shell-extension*
media-video/pipewire
media-video/wireplumber
x11-terms/terminator
x11-terms/xfce4-terminal
www-client/firefox-bin
xfce-base/*
xfce-extra/*
x11-misc/lightdm*
x11-drivers/*
x11-apps/*
app-accessibility/onboard
gnome-extra/iio-sensor-proxy
gnome-extra/nm-applet
media-sound/pavucontrol
sys-apps/xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
# --- agent plumbing the lab and the owner's monitoring need on every test machine
net-vpn/tailscale
app-admin/rustinion-agent
app-backup/restic
